CaesiumOS
===========

Getting started
---------------

To get started with Android platform development, you'll need to get familiar with [Source Control Tools](https://source.android.com/setup/develop). Familiarity with at least the basic syntax of Java, Kotlin or C++ is recommended but not required.

To initialize your local repository using the CaesiumOS trees, use a command like this:
```
repo init -u https://github.com/CaesiumOS/manifest.git -b 16-qpr2 --git-lfs
```
Then to sync up:
```
repo sync
```
Building instructions will be provided soon!


Submitting patches
------------------
Patches are always welcome! Please submit your patches via pull requests (currently the recommended method) or via the CaesiumOS  Gerrit instance (upcoming)!

To view patch status, visit the [Gerrit instance](comingsoon) (upcoming).
